{"seq":3,"slug":"infringement-risk-scoring-model","title":"侵权风险评分模型：仿冒可疑度的特征工程与量化判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/counterfeit-recognition-determination/infringement-risk-scoring-model","wordCount":3118,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"侵权风险评分模型-仿冒可疑度的特征工程与量化判定\">侵权风险评分模型：仿冒可疑度的特征工程与量化判定</h1><p>一条新上架的 listing 在通过审核后的第 4 秒被打了 0.87 的可疑分。这不是「是/否仿冒」的结论，而是一个可排序的概率估计：在同类目、同价位、同账号画像的历史样本中，具有这组信号的商品最终被确认为仿冒的比例约为 87%。商品上架量远超人工审核与品牌方复核的总产能（Amazon 在 Brand Protection Report 中披露的年度品牌保护投入已超过 12 亿美元、专职人员逾 1.5 万名，仍无法逐条人工判定），因此工程问题不是「如何判定一件商品是否仿冒」，而是「如何把有限的人工与法务资源按可疑程度排序投放」。本文讨论这个排序信号的构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可疑度是一个可排序的概率-而非二元标签\">核心概念：可疑度是一个可排序的概率，而非二元标签</h2><p>把仿冒识别当成二分类问题会立刻撞上两个现实约束。第一是<strong>标签稀缺且滞后</strong>：真正确认一件商品是仿冒，通常要等品牌方发起投诉、走完权利判定流程，甚至等法院判决（Nike、Chanel 等品牌对平台及卖家的诉讼周期常以年计），模型训练时只能看到治理闭环已产出的少量正样本。第二是<strong>成本极不对称</strong>：假阳性（正品被误判）会下架合规卖家商品、触发申诉、损害平台与卖家信任；假阴性（仿冒被放行）则让侵权商品继续销售，损害品牌方并给平台带来连带责任风险。两类错误不能用同一个数字衡量。</p>\n<p>因此工程上要产出的是一个<strong>校准后的连续分数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，它的语义是「在给定特征下商品为仿冒的条件概率估计」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x) = \\sigma\\!\\left(w^\\top \\phi(x) + b\\right) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-\\left(w^\\top \\phi(x) + b\\right)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1312em;vertical-align:-0.8097em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2736em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8364em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.782em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8097em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是特征向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w, b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是模型参数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 logistic 函数。分数本身不具备处置含义——处置由下游按分数分层决定。这一「打分与处置解耦」是关键：模型只管排序与概率，阈值与动作由业务成本决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[多模态信号&lt;br/&gt;文本 图像 价格 主体] --&gt; B[特征工程&lt;br/&gt;归一化 交叉 图嵌入]&#10;  B --&gt; C[打分模型&lt;br/&gt;估计 P 仿冒 给定特征]&#10;  C --&gt; D[分数校准&lt;br/&gt;等渗 / Platt 映射为概率]&#10;  D --&gt; E{阈值分层}&#10;  E --&gt;|高分区| F[自动下架&lt;br/&gt;转入权利判定流程]&#10;  E --&gt;|中分区| G[人工复核队列&lt;br/&gt;品牌方协同]&#10;  E --&gt;|低分区| H[放行&lt;br/&gt;抽样监控]\">graph TD\n  A[多模态信号&lt;br/&gt;文本 图像 价格 主体] --&gt; B[特征工程&lt;br/&gt;归一化 交叉 图嵌入]\n  B --&gt; C[打分模型&lt;br/&gt;估计 P 仿冒 给定特征]\n  C --&gt; D[分数校准&lt;br/&gt;等渗 / Platt 映射为概率]\n  D --&gt; E{阈值分层}\n  E --&gt;|高分区| F[自动下架&lt;br/&gt;转入权利判定流程]\n  E --&gt;|中分区| G[人工复核队列&lt;br/&gt;品牌方协同]\n  E --&gt;|低分区| H[放行&lt;br/&gt;抽样监控]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>覆盖能力</th>\n<th>误伤风险</th>\n<th>单位处置成本</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则黑名单（关键词/图像哈希）</td>\n<td>低，只覆盖已知样本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>已知侵权源快速拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续风险评分 + 分层</td>\n<td>高，可外推</td>\n<td>可控（阈值可调）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>上架与在售全周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐条人工判定</td>\n<td>极低，受产能限制</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高价值争议、申诉裁决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信号来源与特征工程-文本-图像-价格-主体-图谱\">信号来源与特征工程：文本、图像、价格、主体、图谱</h2><p>特征工程把异构、噪声大、可被刻意规避的原始信号，转成稳定可比、对规避有鲁棒性的数值向量。五类特征族的可靠性与成本差异很大，实践中按「高置信度优先、低成本兜底」叠加。</p>\n<p><strong>文本特征</strong>处理标题、五点描述与 A+ 内容。核心难点是<strong>规避手法</strong>：侵权卖家会用同形字符替换（<code>nike</code> → <code>n1ke</code>）、插入分隔符（<code>Ro-lex</code>）、拼音谐音、跨语言变体绕开品牌词黑名单。做法不是维护黑名单，而是把品牌名做<strong>归一化与模糊匹配</strong>：Unicode 归一化（NFKC）、去分隔符、同形字符折叠后计算编辑距离或字符 n-gram 相似度，命中阈值即触发信号。另一类高价值信号是绝对化宣称——「100% 正品」「原厂尾单」「代工厂直出」「原单」在正品授权 listing 中几乎不出现，在仿冒 listing 中高频；品牌词与类目错配同样是强信号。</p>\n<p><strong>图像特征</strong>是信号强度最高的一族，因为仿冒的核心是<strong>视觉模仿</strong>，而图像比文本更难规避。三条互补路径：logo 检测与嵌入匹配（目标检测框出 logo 区域，再用嵌入模型比对品牌官方 logo 向量库，输出相似度）；<strong>反向图像检索</strong>（主图是否与已知侵权源、其他高风险账号或网络图库重复命中，重复图库是账号间关联的强证据）；图像质量与来源痕迹（背景抠图残影、分辨率与官方素材不符、水印残留、多账号共用同一张「白底图」）。代价是算力，故只对已被廉价特征筛过的候选集做昂贵比对。</p>\n<p><strong>价格特征</strong>捕捉经济动机。仿冒者靠显著低于正品的价格获取利润空间，「listing 价格 / 品牌建议零售价」的比值、该价格在同类目价格分布中的分位都是有效特征。单一折扣（如「低至 3 折」）在促销场景下正常，需与类目促销周期、历史价格曲线联合判断。<strong>主体与图谱特征</strong>来自账号治理记录与关系图：账号年龄、反馈增速、历史侵权命中，加上跨账号共享的图库、发货地址与收款主体——单个账号可以伪造得干净，但团伙的成本结构迫使它们在图像、物流、资金上留下共用节点，故图谱特征是识别有组织仿冒的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征族</th>\n<th>代表特征</th>\n<th>信号强度</th>\n<th>主要规避手法</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>品牌名归一化模糊匹配、绝对化宣称、类目错配</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>同形字符、谐音、跨语言</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>logo 嵌入相似度、反向图像重复命中、抠图残影</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>改图、换背景、二次压缩</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>相对建议零售价折扣、类目价格分位</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>抬高标价再打折</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>账号年龄、反馈增速、历史命中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>养号、买号</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图谱</td>\n<td>跨账号共享图库/地址/资金节点</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>拆分账号、变更节点</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从特征到分数-模型选择-校准与评价指标\">从特征到分数：模型选择、校准与评价指标</h2><p>基座模型实践中以<strong>梯度提升树</strong>（如 XGBoost、LightGBM）为主，因为它对混合类型特征（类别、计数、连续）天然适配、对缺失值鲁棒、且可解释——特征重要性可直接支撑治理团队理解「为什么这条被判高分」。深度模型（logo 嵌入网络、多模态图文匹配）通常作为<strong>特征生成器</strong>嵌入树模型上游，而非端到端替换，因为端到端深度模型在正样本极少时容易过拟合且难以审计。图谱特征则通过图嵌入或邻域统计量并入同一向量。训练的核心问题是<strong>样本选择偏差</strong>：正样本来自治理闭环已确认的商品，而历史判定受旧模型影响形成反馈回路（旧模型没抓到的仿冒永不进入正样本）。缓解手段：按时间切分而非随机切分、在复核队列保留随机抽样、把「品牌方投诉」与「平台主动发现」两类正样本分开建模。</p>\n<p><strong>校准</strong>是把模型输出（任意尺度的分数或排序值）映射为真实概率的过程。树模型的原始分数不天然是概率，需用 Platt scaling（对分数做 logistic 回归）或等渗回归压到校准概率。校准的意义在于下游能用概率做<strong>成本计算</strong>——只有分数与真实概率对齐，「0.87 对应 87% 命中率」才成立，阈值才能按货币化成本推导。评价指标要匹配业务：<strong>Precision@K</strong>（在复核产能 K 约束下前 K 个高分商品的准确率）比全局 AUC 更贴近实际，因为复核是有限资源；全局指标好看但 top-K 不准的模型毫无用处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定阈值与分层处置-把不对称成本写进决策\">判定阈值与分层处置：把不对称成本写进决策</h2><p>有了校准概率，阈值就不该是常数，而应由<strong>期望成本最小化</strong>导出。设阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x) \\geq T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的商品被处置，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></munder><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^{*} = \\arg\\min_{T}\\ \\Big[\\, c_{FP} \\cdot \\mathrm{FP}(T) \\;+\\; c_{FN} \\cdot \\mathrm{FN}(T) \\,\\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FN</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{FP}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{FN}(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FN</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是该阈值下的假阳性与假阴性数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两类错误的单位成本。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（一次错误下架的正品卖家流失 + 申诉成本 + 品牌信任损失），因此最优阈值往往偏高——宁可漏放一些低分疑似，也不轻易自动下架，生产系统普遍采用分层处置而非单点阈值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[商品获得校准分 s] --&gt; H1{s ≥ 0.9}&#10;  H1 --&gt;|是| A[自动下架&lt;br/&gt;并通知品牌方]&#10;  H1 --&gt;|否| H2{s ≥ 0.6}&#10;  H2 --&gt;|是| M[进入人工/品牌方复核&lt;br/&gt;限时裁决]&#10;  H2 --&gt;|否| L[放行&lt;br/&gt;持续监控复评]&#10;  A --&gt; AP{卖家申诉}&#10;  M --&gt; AP&#10;  AP --&gt;|申诉成立| R[恢复 listing&lt;br/&gt;回写为负样本]&#10;  AP --&gt;|申诉驳回| K[维持处置&lt;br/&gt;回写正样本]&#10;  R --&gt; FB[反馈入训练集]&#10;  K --&gt; FB\">flowchart TD\n  S[商品获得校准分 s] --&gt; H1{s ≥ 0.9}\n  H1 --&gt;|是| A[自动下架&lt;br/&gt;并通知品牌方]\n  H1 --&gt;|否| H2{s ≥ 0.6}\n  H2 --&gt;|是| M[进入人工/品牌方复核&lt;br/&gt;限时裁决]\n  H2 --&gt;|否| L[放行&lt;br/&gt;持续监控复评]\n  A --&gt; AP{卖家申诉}\n  M --&gt; AP\n  AP --&gt;|申诉成立| R[恢复 listing&lt;br/&gt;回写为负样本]\n  AP --&gt;|申诉驳回| K[维持处置&lt;br/&gt;回写正样本]\n  R --&gt; FB[反馈入训练集]\n  K --&gt; FB</pre><p>分层把「确定性高的动作」与「确定性低的动作」分开：高分区直接下架并转入权利判定（由品牌方或平台依商标、专利、著作权进行法律定性），中分区进入限时人工或品牌方协同复核，低分区放行但保持监控复评（仿冒者常先用干净 listing 养权重，再逐步改图改词，动态复评能抓住这种「洗白后转黑」的行为）。申诉回执是最宝贵的标签来源，无论成立与否都应结构化回写、闭环进训练集。成本参数需品牌方、法务与运营共同设定并随类目变化，奢侈品类的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级和普通类目完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地与对抗演化-漂移-规避与监控\">工程落地与对抗演化：漂移、规避与监控</h2><p>风险评分不是上线即结束的静态系统，它面对的是<strong>主动对抗的对手</strong>。三个必须持续投入的工程面：</p>\n<p><strong>特征漂移与规避演化。</strong> 当某特征被模型依赖后，对手会集中攻击它——同形字符替换、图像二次压缩、抬高标价再打折，都是针对特定特征的定向规避。应对方式是特征冗余（多族信号交叉验证，单一特征失效不致命）、定期用新数据重训并监测特征重要性漂移、把「规避手法本身」当作信号。</p>\n<p><strong>监控指标。</strong> 需同时监控模型侧与业务侧：分数分布漂移（PSI/KS）、top-K 精确率时间序列、自动处置量与被申诉率、标签延迟。被申诉率突然上升通常意味着模型开始误伤，是阈值或特征需复核的早期信号。</p>\n<p><strong>合规与边界。</strong> 平台侧的自动化处置受监管约束。欧盟《数字服务法》（Regulation (EU) 2022/2065，DSA）第 34、35 条要求超大型平台评估并缓解系统性风险，且对自动化限制措施规定透明度与申诉义务；美国《INFORM Consumers Act》（2023 年 6 月 27 日生效）要求披露高销量第三方卖家信息；中国《电子商务法》第 41 至 45 条与 GB/T 39550-2020《电子商务平台知识产权保护管理》对「通知—删除—申诉」机制提出要求。共同约束是：模型可以打分与排序，但高影响力的自动化动作必须可解释、可申诉、可追溯。跨平台数据协作（如 OECD 与 EUIPO 假货贸易报告所衡量的规模）能显著提升图谱特征的覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>仿冒识别应产出<strong>校准后的连续可疑分</strong>，把排序与处置解耦；二元判定在标签稀缺与成本不对称下不可行。</li>\n<li>五类特征族（文本、图像、价格、主体、图谱）信号强度与成本各异，按「高置信优先、低成本兜底」叠加，并针对同形字符、改图、养号等规避手法做归一化与冗余设计。</li>\n<li>基座用梯度提升树、深度模型做特征生成、图谱特征补团伙识别；必须做概率校准（Platt / 等渗），否则下游无法据分数做成本决策。</li>\n<li>阈值由期望成本最小化导出（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），故采用分层处置（自动下架 / 人工复核 / 放行监控），申诉回执闭环为标签。</li>\n<li>系统面对主动对抗的对手，需持续监控特征漂移、top-K 精确率与被申诉率，并在 DSA、INFORM Consumers Act、中国《电子商务法》与 GB/T 39550-2020 框架内约束自动化处置边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"侵权风险评分模型：仿冒可疑度的特征工程与量化判定","id":"侵权风险评分模型-仿冒可疑度的特征工程与量化判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可疑度是一个可排序的概率，而非二元标签","id":"核心概念-可疑度是一个可排序的概率-而非二元标签"},{"level":2,"text":"信号来源与特征工程：文本、图像、价格、主体、图谱","id":"信号来源与特征工程-文本-图像-价格-主体-图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"从特征到分数：模型选择、校准与评价指标","id":"从特征到分数-模型选择-校准与评价指标"},{"level":2,"text":"判定阈值与分层处置：把不对称成本写进决策","id":"判定阈值与分层处置-把不对称成本写进决策"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地与对抗演化：漂移、规避与监控","id":"工程落地与对抗演化-漂移-规避与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平行进口的法律边界：地域权利用尽、许可与合法性判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/counterfeit-recognition-determination/parallel-import-legal-boundary"},"next":{"title":"打假取证与证据链保全：购买测试、公证固证与举证规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/enforcement-evidence-pipeline/evidence-collection-chain-custody"}}